# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Event 13: Recommendation — lower-power GPU
# Note: This references a product that would exist in a fuller catalog.
# For this sample data we reference the RX 7800 XT as the closest match,
# though in reality the assistant would recommend a lower-tier card like
# an RTX 4060 or RX 7600. The interaction pattern is what matters here.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

ev:upgrade-013 a ix:RecommendationReceived, ix:SatisfactionSignal ;
    rdfs:label "Power-efficient GPU recommendation" ;
    rdfs:comment "Assistant recommends a GPU that fits within the 500W PSU constraint. User is relieved that a simpler path exists." ;
