    ix:recommendedProduct p:amd-rx-7800-xt ;
    ix:recommendationReason "The RX 7800 XT draws 263W — with your i5-10400 at 65W and other components, you are right at the edge of 500W. It would be a massive upgrade from the 1660 Super and requires no other changes to your system." ;
    ix:recommendationAccepted true ;
    ix:signalStrength "moderate" .

